# Session layer

In the forum-iOS checkout, read `docs/session.md` before changing live-room code.

- Socket side effects → `SessionSocketEventHandler` (+ owner protocol hooks if needed)
- Sheets/modals → `SessionNavigationCoordinator`
- Toasts → `SessionToastPresenter`
- Transcript mutations for collaborators → `SessionMessageStore` (not full `MessagesVC`)
- Prefer extending these helpers over growing `SessionVC` further
